      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez, Tāwhaki subió por las enredaderas hasta el cielo.",
          "en": "Last time, Tāwhaki climbed the vines all the way up into the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero en la tierra, Tāwhaki tenía un hijo llamado Wahieroa.",
          "en": "But down on earth, Tāwhaki had a son named Wahieroa."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y Wahieroa tuvo su propio hijo: Rātā. Esta es su historia.",
          "en": "And Wahieroa had a son of his own: Rātā. This is his story."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así la publicó George Grey en 1855, en su libro Polynesian Mythology.",
          "en": "This is how George Grey published it in 1855, in his book Polynesian Mythology."
        },
        {
          "es": "Muchas tribus la cuentan, cada una a su manera. Pero empieza con una gran pérdida.",
          "en": "Many tribes tell it, each in its own way. But it begins with a terrible loss."
        }
