      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero el trabajo de Rātā no había terminado. Los huesos de su padre estaban lejos, al otro lado del mar.",
          "en": "But Rātā's work was not done. His father's bones were far away, across the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Para traerlos a casa, necesitaba una canoa. Una grande.",
          "en": "To bring them home, he would need a canoe. A big one."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que tomó su toki, su azuela de piedra, y se fue al bosque.",
          "en": "So he took his toki, his stone adze, and went into the forest."
        },
        {
          "es": "Necesitaba el mejor árbol de todo el bosque.",
          "en": "He would need the finest tree in the whole forest."
        }
